{"product_id":"rover-elite-earbuds","title":"Rover Elite Earbuds","description":"\u003ch2\u003eRover Elite Earbuds – Power Meets Performance\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExperience high-quality sound, stable connectivity, and long-lasting battery life with the Rover Elite Earbuds. Built for everyday use, these earbuds offer a perfect balance of performance and comfort.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSound Quality\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEnjoy clear audio with deep bass and balanced output. With SBC and AAC support, the Rover Elite Earbuds deliver a smooth listening experience for music, calls, and videos.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eBattery Life\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe earbuds provide up to 7 hours of playtime on a single charge, with a total of up to 35 hours using the charging case. Fast charging ensures the earbuds are ready in about 45 minutes, while the case takes around 1.5 hours.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eConnectivity\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEquipped with Bluetooth 5.4, the Rover Elite Earbuds ensure a stable and fast connection with a range of over 10 meters. It also supports quick pairing and smooth device switching.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eLow Latency Mode\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith 60ms low latency, these earbuds are suitable for gaming and video streaming, keeping audio in sync with visuals.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eCall Quality\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDual microphones with ENC noise reduction help reduce background noise, providing clear voice calls in different environments.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eWater Resistance\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIPX4 rating makes the earbuds resistant to sweat and light splashes, making them suitable for workouts and outdoor use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eControls\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTouch controls allow you to manage music, calls, volume, and voice assistants like Siri or Google Assistant easily.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eDesign\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe earbuds feature a lightweight and ergonomic design for comfortable long-term use. Available in Beige, Blue, Green, and Black.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eBox Contents\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLeft and right earbuds\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCharging cable\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUser manual\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWarranty card\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUp to 35 hours total battery life\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBluetooth 5.4 connectivity\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLow latency for gaming\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eENC for clear calls\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eComfortable and minimal design\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Shadow Black","offer_id":51123063783702,"sku":"24341","price":3999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Moss Green","offer_id":51123063750934,"sku":"24340","price":3999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Ivory Beige","offer_id":51123063816470,"sku":"24339","price":3999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Arctic Sky","offer_id":51123063849238,"sku":"23887","price":3999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Rover-blackk-3.webp?v=1774434409","url":"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/products\/rover-elite-earbuds","provider":"ZeroLifestyle.co","version":"1.0","type":"link"}